{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review Food Security and Self Reliance Strategy. Pause not-yet-started NSIPs",
        "additional_details": "In our view, at a time of geopolitical uncertainty, losing countryside to large industrial energy schemes is strategically unsound. This petition calls for Government to pause all not yet started Nationally Significant Infrastructure Projects \u2014 whether already approved but not yet broken ground, or still awaiting examination \u2014 so that we can review our ability to build and maintain its own lower-land-take energy systems and safeguard domestic food production",
        "background": "We believe more must be done to protect our food security, national security and farmland. Stop large-land-take solar schemes, review lower-land-take alternatives. Prioritise UK industry, home-grown energy, and self-reliance. Safeguard our domestic food production.",
